epiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":13,"created_at":"2026-06-20T19:32:39Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T16:25:21Z","closed_at":"2026-08-21T16:25:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.5.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M5 (Apple9) - Apple M5 (10 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using SDFGI with Metal the light sources don't seem to be contributing to the indirect lighting bounces.\nSDFGI Probes are not picking up on the bounced lighting from the surfaces that are lit by a light source.\nEmissive meshes are working as intended.\nSwitching to Vulkan (while still on a mac) fixes the issue.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen up a new scene.\nPlace;\n- World Environment\n- Directional Light\n- A ground mesh\n- A few simple meshes above the ground\nthen turn on SDFGI on the World Environment.\n\nTemporary Fix:\nGo to Project Settings>Rendering>Rendering Device\nSwitch MacOS Driver to Vulkan\nRestart the project.\n\n<img width=\"1339\" height=\"758\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb1f6fe6-2712-4d01-9e4a-4803bf2827de\" />\n<img width=\"1339\" height=\"758\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c976f459-0492-46b7-8860-46c5982956f3\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[GraphicsGym.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29166313/GraphicsGym.zip)\nIt is also reproducible on Godot's own 3d/global_illumination demo project.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120496/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120496/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}